  "abstract": "Same as LearnableGamma but adds a tiny \u2018First4\u2019 anchor on \u03b3[t] to preserve RC-dominated early steps: penalize (\u03b3[0:4]\u22121)^2 with \u03bb_early=1e\u22125. Tests if early-step preservation improves over baseline learnable \u03b3.",
  "submitted_tick": 218,
